  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Zilliz Cloud management plugin with 14 skills covering cluster lifecycle, collection schema, vector search, index tuning, bulk import, RBAC, backups, and monitoring.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install zilliz@claude-plugins-official` from `zilliztech/zilliz-plugin`.\n\nYour Zilliz Cloud console in your AI coding agent. This plugin lets Claude Code or OpenAI Codex operate the `zilliz-cli`, bringing the full power of Zilliz Cloud — cluster management, collection operations, vector search, RBAC, backups, and more — into your terminal through natural language.",
